
the model declares itself

  [PASS] the module registered
  [PASS] it names its method as a DC injection response, not a load flow
  [PASS] it publishes its equations
  [PASS] it declares the base it works on
  [PASS] it states that resistance is not used
  [PASS] it states that shunt susceptance is not used
  [PASS] it states the flat-voltage assumption
  [PASS] it states the small-angle assumption
  [PASS] it states that losses are zero by construction
  [PASS] it states that taps are not published and not modelled
  [PASS] it states that no contingency is modelled
  [PASS] it refuses to be read as a loading
  [PASS] it refuses to be read as a connection offer
  [PASS] the module never reads the resistance field
  [PASS] the module never reads the susceptance field
  [PASS] the module does read the reactance field, which is what it declares

validation against networks whose answers are exact by hand

  [PASS] one branch between injection and slack carries 100% of it
  [PASS] and carries it in MW, on the declared base
  [PASS] the reactance does not change a single-path answer
  [PASS] Kirchhoff at the injection is satisfied exactly
  [PASS] the solve reports that it converged
  [PASS] two parallel paths divide inversely as their reactances (2/3, 1/3)
  [PASS] the two shares sum to exactly one
  [PASS] in MW that is 200 and 100 of a 300 MW injection
  [PASS] a symmetric ring sends 2/3 the direct way
  [PASS] and 1/3 the long way round
  [PASS] the long way round carries the same share on its second leg
  [PASS] a ring puts flow on a branch that touches neither end of the transfer
  [PASS] every branch in series carries the entire transfer
  [PASS] reversing the transfer reverses every branch flow exactly
  [PASS] the zero-reactance branch was shorted, not modelled
  [PASS] the two shorted nodes became one bus
  [PASS] injecting at either end of a short gives the same answer
  [PASS] because they are the same bus
  [PASS] a transfer within one bus is refused and explained
  [PASS] a branch with no published reactance is not invented

